Excellent. You AC is okay for now. You shall start collecting daggers
for _ranged attacks_; Valkyries can get Expert in daggers! The wand of
lightning is a very good _defensive_ object, you can reliably engrave
the E-word and the engraving won't erase even if fighting. Otherwise
just writing in the dust with your fingers and using conflict helps in
crowded areas. (But keep in mind that most but not all monsters
respect the E-word.) Before you meet any high level spellcaster you
should try to get MR, and you need a unicorn horn to handle the daily
interferences.

